{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 0, "start_seconds": 0.0, "end_seconds": 2.7200000286102295, "text": "¿Alguna vez mandaste un mensaje que no deberías haber mandado", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 1, "start_seconds": 2.7200000286102295, "end_seconds": 4.679999828338623, "text": "y te arrepentiste dos segundos después?", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 2, "start_seconds": 4.679999828338623, "end_seconds": 6.239999771118164, "text": "Bueno, ese no fuiste vos.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 3, "start_seconds": 6.239999771118164, "end_seconds": 8.239999771118164, "text": "Nuestro cerebro tiene dos sistemas de decisión.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 4, "start_seconds": 8.239999771118164, "end_seconds": 10.640000343322754, "text": "Uno rápido, emocional, automático.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 5, "start_seconds": 10.640000343322754, "end_seconds": 12.920000076293945, "text": "Y otro lento, analítico y reflexivo.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 6, "start_seconds": 12.920000076293945, "end_seconds": 16.239999771118164, "text": "El problema es que el emocional siempre llega antes.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 7, "start_seconds": 16.239999771118164, "end_seconds": 19.68000030517578, "text": "Y en ese segundo, clic, mandaste el mensaje que no deberías,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 8, "start_seconds": 19.68000030517578, "end_seconds": 21.440000534057617, "text": "haces la compra que no necesitabas", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 9, "start_seconds": 21.440000534057617, "end_seconds": 24.399999618530273, "text": "o decís algo que te arrepentís apenas lo dijiste.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 10, "start_seconds": 24.399999618530273, "end_seconds": 26.1200008392334, "text": "No fuiste vos. Fue tu amígdala.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 11, "start_seconds": 26.1200008392334, "end_seconds": 28.479999542236328, "text": "La amígdala reacciona una fracción de segundo", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 12, "start_seconds": 28.479999542236328, "end_seconds": 30.360000610351562, "text": "antes de que la corteza prefrontal", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 13, "start_seconds": 30.360000610351562, "end_seconds": 32.31999969482422, "text": "procese la información racionalmente.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 14, "start_seconds": 32.31999969482422, "end_seconds": 36.52000045776367, "text": "Esto significa que literalmente sentimos antes de pensar.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 15, "start_seconds": 36.52000045776367, "end_seconds": 39.91999816894531, "text": "Por eso a veces actuamos por enojo, miedo o euforia", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 16, "start_seconds": 39.91999816894531, "end_seconds": 42.119998931884766, "text": "y después inventamos una explicación lógica", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 17, "start_seconds": 42.119998931884766, "end_seconds": 43.52000045776367, "text": "para justificar lo que hicimos.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 18, "start_seconds": 43.52000045776367, "end_seconds": 45.36000061035156, "text": "Si no sabes cuándo escuchar a tu intuición", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 19, "start_seconds": 45.36000061035156, "end_seconds": 47.31999969482422, "text": "y no lográs frenar a tiempo tus impulsos,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 20, "start_seconds": 47.31999969482422, "end_seconds": 48.47999954223633, "text": "el resultado es claro.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 21, "start_seconds": 48.47999954223633, "end_seconds": 51.7599983215332, "text": "No solo te equivocás, sino que lo haces a toda velocidad.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 22, "start_seconds": 51.7599983215332, "end_seconds": 55.20000076293945, "text": "Y cuidado, porque la impulsividad suele venir disfrazada de coraje.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 23, "start_seconds": 55.2400016784668, "end_seconds": 56.720001220703125, "text": "Pero, como dice el refrán,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 24, "start_seconds": 56.720001220703125, "end_seconds": 59.52000045776367, "text": "el cementerio está lleno de valientes.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 25, "start_seconds": 59.52000045776367, "end_seconds": 61.279998779296875, "text": "No todo salto al vacío es valentía.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 26, "start_seconds": 61.279998779296875, "end_seconds": 64.4800033569336, "text": "A veces es pura imprudencia y falta de equilibrio emocional.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 27, "start_seconds": 64.4800033569336, "end_seconds": 67.5999984741211, "text": "La impulsividad es la contracara de la procrastinación", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 28, "start_seconds": 67.5999984741211, "end_seconds": 69.0, "text": "o la parálisis por análisis.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 29, "start_seconds": 69.0, "end_seconds": 71.04000091552734, "text": "Una te hace postergar por miedo,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 30, "start_seconds": 71.04000091552734, "end_seconds": 73.23999786376953, "text": "la otra te hace apresurar por ansiedad.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 31, "start_seconds": 73.23999786376953, "end_seconds": 74.4800033569336, "text": "Y las dos tienen algo en común,", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 32, "start_seconds": 74.4800033569336, "end_seconds": 76.23999786376953, "text": "te hacen dejar de estar en control.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 33, "start_seconds": 76.23999786376953, "end_seconds": 79.08000183105469, "text": "En ese delicado equilibrio entre emoción y razón", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 34, "start_seconds": 79.08000183105469, "end_seconds": 82.0, "text": "se juega buena parte de la calidad de nuestras decisiones.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 35, "start_seconds": 82.0, "end_seconds": 85.0, "text": "Actuar con inteligencia no significa no tener ideas estúpidas.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 36, "start_seconds": 85.0, "end_seconds": 86.23999786376953, "text": "¡Todas las tenemos!", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 37, "start_seconds": 86.23999786376953, "end_seconds": 89.76000213623047, "text": "La clave es ser capaz de identificar nuestros propios arrebatos", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 38, "start_seconds": 89.76000213623047, "end_seconds": 91.5999984741211, "text": "y tener el control inhibitorio", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
{"video_id": "-oVY_xzW-no", "segment_index": 39, "start_seconds": 91.5999984741211, "end_seconds": 93.63999938964844, "text": "para no seguir esos pensamientos precipitados.", "transcription_model": "whisper-1"}
